<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Corporate Express MD resigns.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Corporate Express MD resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Office supplies retailer Corporate Express Australia Ltd, which is controlled by Corporate Express Inc, said on Monday its managing director Martin Chimes had resigned.</p>
<p>The company said that pending the search for and appointment of a new managing director, the board has appointed Scott Lehman, who is currently Vice President of Corporate Express Inc, as acting managing director.</p>
<p>Earlier Corporate Express reported a loss of A$1.56 million for the six months ended August 31, compared with a profit of A$1.90 million a year earlier.  </p>
<p>Corporate Express shares closed eight cents up at A$1.43.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
